<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__media" style="background-image:url('assets/img/tz-serengeti.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">Tanzania · Itinerary</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">The Great Migration</h1>
      <div class="itin-meta reveal">
        <span><b>7 days</b></span>
        <span>Serengeti · Jun–Oct</span>
        <span>Private or small-group</span>
        <span>from <b>$7,400</b> / person</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__actions reveal" style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a href="contact.html?trip=The%20Great%20Migration%20%E2%80%94%20Tanzania" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this trip</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="tanzania.html">Tanzania</a> / The Great Migration</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">Front-row seats to the greatest wildlife spectacle on earth — more than a million wildebeest and zebra massing on the banks of the Mara River, then plunging across in a thunder of dust and water.</p>
        <p>We place you in intimate camps right on the herds' seasonal path, with a guide who reads the plains and the patience to wait for the moment. Timed for the crossings, roughly June to October.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your 7-day journey</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 1</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Fly to the northern Serengeti</h3><p>Arrive at Kilimanjaro and connect by light aircraft to the northern Serengeti, landing close to the migration's river country. An afternoon drive among the gathering herds.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Northern Serengeti migration camp · <b>Meals:</b> All from lunch</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 2</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Mara River country</h3><p>Morning and afternoon drives tracking the wildebeest toward the river, reading their restless movement as pressure builds at the crossing points.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Northern Serengeti migration camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 3</div><div class="day__body"><h3>The crossings</h3><p>A full, flexible day positioned at the river. When the moment comes the herds surge across in their thousands — heart-stopping, and worth every patient hour.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Northern Serengeti migration camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 4</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Predators &amp; plains</h3><p>Where the herds go, the big cats follow. Lion prides, cheetah on the termite mounds and hyena clans — the drama that trails the migration.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Northern Serengeti migration camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 5</div><div class="day__body"><h3>South to the central plains</h3><p>Transfer toward the central Serengeti, game viewing along the way. An optional dawn hot-air balloon drifts you over the savanna with a champagne bush breakfast to land.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Central Serengeti camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 6</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Serengeti at leisure</h3><p>Unhurried morning and afternoon drives among the kopjes and rivers of the Seronera, with time to simply sit with a sighting.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Central Serengeti camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 7</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Fly home</h3><p>A final sunrise drive, then a light-aircraft flight back to Kilimanjaro for your onward connection.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Where you'll stay</p><h2 class="section__title">Camps &amp; lodges</h2></div>
      <div class="related__grid reveal">
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=The%20Great%20Migration%20%E2%80%94%20Tanzania"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-suite.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Migration mobile camp</h3><p>Seasonal canvas that moves with the herds.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=The%20Great%20Migration%20%E2%80%94%20Tanzania"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-tent.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Sayari-style camp</h3><p>An elegant base above the Mara River.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=The%20Great%20Migration%20%E2%80%94%20Tanzania"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-view.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Central Serengeti camp</h3><p>Classic tented luxury on the plains.</p></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="incl reveal">
        <div class="section__head section__head--left"><p class="eyebrow">All taken care of</p><h2 class="section__title">What's included</h2></div>
        <ul class="incl__grid">
          <li>All light-aircraft flights &amp; transfers</li>
          <li>Hand-picked migration &amp; Serengeti camps</li>
          <li>Shared or private 4x4 game drives</li>
          <li>Expert migration guide</li>
          <li>All park &amp; conservation fees</li>
          <li>All meals as shown</li>
          <li>Drinking water in the vehicle</li>
          <li>24/7 Rendile concierge &amp; all gratuities</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">From <strong>$7,400 per person sharing</strong>; single supplement available. International flights, visas and the optional balloon safari are extra. Crossings are seasonal (roughly June–October) and never guaranteed — we position you for the best chance.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
